      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "1st Class Properties are delighted to bring to the market this stunning newly decorated property in walk in condition. \nNo. 38 Holly Road is a charming 3 bedroom terrace family home with a fantastic location just off Collins Avenue, within walking distance to an abundance of local amenities.\nThe property briefly comprises of an entrance hall, open plan dining room/lounge extended and fully fitted kitchen leading onto to a private, West facing private rear garden. On the first floor there are two large double bedrooms and a good size single bedroom.\n\nNo.38 Holly Road is situated close to all local amenities including shops, cafes and restaurants, Fairview Park and stunning coastal walks at Clontarf's promenade. The house is within easy access of excellent primary and secondary schools, Westwood Fitness Centre, Clontarf DART station and East Point Business Park. The city centre and the IFSC is less than a short 10 minute drive away. All the Dublin Third level colleges are very accessible, with Dublin City University and St Patrick's Teacher Training College close by. Numerous bus services are very frequent and nearby. For those travelling further afield the M50, M1 and Dublin Airport are within an easy commuting distance.\n\nViewing is by appointment only."
      },
